{"id":"diante","lemma":"diante","pos":"adv","rank":860,"glosses":["in front of","before","ahead (in time)"],"ipa":"/d͡ʒiˈɐ̃.t͡ʃi/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/b4/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Santamarcanda-diante.wav/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Santamarcanda-diante.wav.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Eu me sinto bem diante das coisas.","en":"I feel good about things.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1270527","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to sense","l":"sentir"},{"g":"well"},null,null,{"g":"thing","l":"coisa"}]},{"text":"O que acontece de agora em diante?","en":"What happens from here?","words":[null,null,{"g":"to happen","l":"acontecer"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"now"},{"g":"in"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"what"]]},{"text":"Ela ficou parada diante do espelho.","en":"She stood in front of the mirror.","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"to become","l":"ficar"},{"g":"halt"},null,{"g":"of the"},{"g":"mirror"}]},{"text":"Tom está diante de uma escolha difícil.","en":"Tom is faced with a difficult choice.","words":[{"g":"tone"},{"g":"is","l":"estar"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"a","l":"um"},{"g":"choice"},{"g":"difficult"}]},{"text":"De agora em diante tente chegar na hora.","en":"From now on, try to arrive on time.","words":[{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"now"},{"g":"in"},null,{"g":"to try","l":"tentar"},{"g":"to arrive"},null,null],"phrases":[[6,8,"in the right moment"]]}]}